SCOPE. The MIT License below covers the SOURCE CODE of this repository only
(src/, scripts/, experiments/, tests/). The datasets under data/ are third-party
works released under their own terms and are NOT relicensed here: the mined
if-then corpus (data/if_then/paper/beck_2022*) inherits CC BY-NC 4.0 from openESM
dataset 0060_beck (Beck & Jackson, 2022), and the Mini-IPIP item bank (Donnellan
et al., 2006) is public domain.

The experiment logs under runs/ are released under CC BY-NC 4.0. Many of them
record prompts that quote the mined corpus verbatim, which makes those logs
adapted material under the openESM terms. We apply the stricter term to the whole
directory rather than licensing it file by file, because the boundary can only be
drawn by text matching and an error in the permissive direction would purport to
waive rights we do not hold. See section 6 of README.md.

